    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33068" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκτράπελος</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span></span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>turning from the common course, perverse,
