				Pherecr.
				145.23
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				14.9
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζῷα</span> (i. e. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κύκλωπες</span>) <i><span class="en">
